OL,3,ADUP blocks Michelle O'Neill's
OL,4,Aengagements over Drumcree
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's First Minister
OL,7,FMichelle O'Neill has been blocked by
OL,8,Fthe DUP from attending an economic
OL,9,Fsummit involving Prime Minister Andy
OL,10,FBurnham.
OL,12,FThe Sinn Fein vice-president and Deputy
OL,13,FFirst Minister Emma Little-Pengelly
OL,14,Fwere both invited to attend the
OL,15,FNational Economic Council in Glasgow on
OL,16,FFriday with other devolved leaders.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
